{{#> layout title=(concat "Welcome to " appName) preheader="Your account is ready. Three steps to your first reply from a model on your own computer." reason=(concat "because a " appName " account was made with this address")}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Hi {{firstName}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">Your account is ready. {{appName}} runs AI models on your own computers, so your chats stay with you. Three steps to your first reply:</p>
{{#> details}}{{> step number="1" title="Install Ollama" text="One installer. Mollama finds it by itself."}}{{> step number="2" title="Pick a model" text="Choose one that fits your computer and press Download."}}{{> step number="3" title="Ask" text="Open Chat and type. Nothing to set up first."}}{{/details}}
{{> button url=loginUrl label="Open Mollama"}}
<p class="muted" style="margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:22px; color:{{look.muted}};">The same sign-in opens your FilesystemOne files, so you can attach them to a chat.</p>
{{/layout}}
